  "prefLabel": "Fam 700 CONTINUED STATUS OF CERTIFIED FAMILY MEDIATOR TRAINING PROGRAMS",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Fam 700 CONTINUED STATUS OF CERTIFIED FAMILY MEDIATOR TRAINING PROGRAMS\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #9676, effective 4-2-10, readopted with amendments and redesignated the former Chapter Mar 700 as Chapter Fam 700. The redesignation from title Mar to Fam was done due to the renaming of the Board of Marital Mediator Certification as the Board of Family Mediator Certification pursuant to 2009, 21:4, effective 1-1-10. Document # 9676 replaces all prior filings for rules formerly in Chapter Mar 700. The numerals of the rules remained unchanged, and the source note information for the rules under Document #9676 refer to those same numbers under the title Mar.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fam100-800.html"
